Charlie Hull of OpenSource Connections welcomes you to Haystack US 2024! Featuring a short talk on the people of search - the giants on whose shoulders we stand, the people of today and the people we've lost. He also announces the winners of the Hughes Scholarship and the 5000th member of Relevance Slack!

Haystack US 2024 brought to you by OpenSource Connections, Experts in Search & AI, offering consulting, training and specialist staffing - talk to us about your search & AI project at https://www.opensourceconnections.com